 		A^{x,y_1,y_2}_{a_1,\,a_2} \ot \Id \simeq_{\delta_{\mathrm{pasting}}} \Id \ot J^x_{[\operatorname{eval}_{y_1}(\cdot)=a_1,\, \operatorname{eval}_{y_2}(\cdot)=a_2]}\,.
